---
import AffiliateLink from './AffiliateLink.astro';
import { EDUBAWARE_FREE_URL, ICM_PAPER_URL } from '../consts';
---

<section class="method-band" id="method">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>The method is Jake's. The teaching is mine.</h2>
    <div class="columns">
      <article class="card depth-box">
        <p class="label">The method</p>
        <h3>ICM Principles by Jake Van Clief</h3>
        <p>
          Jake Van Clief is the person behind Interpretable Context Methodology, or ICM. ICM structure
          has folders and notes that show AI where to look. Jake and David McDermott published it in
          2026. <a href={ICM_PAPER_URL}>Read the ICM paper</a>.
        </p>
        <AffiliateLink fillCard edubawareColor />
      </article>
      <article class="card depth-box">
        <p class="label">The teacher</p>
        <h3>Jeff van Leenen</h3>
        <p>
          I have been a teacher for over 24 years. Now I am also an executive at a home building company, so I
          know the office work behind the job. I am one of Jake Van Clief's 7 Masters of ICM.
        </p>
        <p>You bring your task, and I help you apply his method to it.</p>
        <a class="button button-edubaware door-button action" href={EDUBAWARE_FREE_URL}>Start free</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .method-band {
    margin-top: var(--space-7);
    padding: var(--space-7) 0;
    background: var(--cream);
  }

  .columns {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: var(--space-5);
    background: var(--white);
    border: 2px solid var(--navy);
    border-top: 6px solid var(--edubaware);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .label {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    color: var(--edubaware);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h3 {
    color: var(--edubaware);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .action {
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .columns {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
